                                                "sense_id": "87fce8ae-d0e8-3c9f-a2a0-7d9b45253832",
                                                "text": "At various times and in different areas salads, compounded of meats, spices, tubers have been treated as of aphrodisiac value."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b1d3e42-5d0b-44da-992b-c589ecb5a589",
                                                "sense_id": "87fce8ae-d0e8-3c9f-a2a0-7d9b45253832",
